<title>FRANCE: No decision yet on Koipe stake-Eridania.</title>
<headline>No decision yet on Koipe stake-Eridania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eridania Beghin-Say said on Thursday that it had made no decision over increasing its stake in Spanish olive oil group Koipe.</p>
<p>Spanish tobacco group Tabacalera has said it may sell its 9.66 percent stake in Koipe to Eridania.</p>
<p>&quot;We have made no decision,&quot; an Eridania spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>In June, Eridania Beghin-Say purchased from Food Premier a stake of some 4.8 percent in Koipe, increasing its interest in the group to 66.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
